! GAMESS/VB2000 Test 40.
! This run is an example of a VB2000 run for a closed shell case with
! the structures selected by ionicity or seniority number. It is for
! benzene with STO-6G and structures selected from ionicity 0 and 2,
! equivalent to seniority numbers 6 and 2. This leads to 90 structures
! of ionicity 2 (seniority 2) are added to the 5 spin coupled structures
! of ionicity 0 (seniority 6). Adding these 90 structures gets a result 
! closer to the full CASVB than adding any other single ionicity 
! (seniority) set of structures to the 5 SC structures.
!
! The geometry and basis set and therefore the RHF energy are identical
! to exam-vb24.
!
! The RHF energy is:-
!
! RHF ENERGY IS -230.1300205664 AFTER   8 ITERATIONS
!
! The VB final energy is:-
!
! ENERGY AND DIFF OF MACROITER    4 =   -230.2376633323     -0.0000000003
!
! This energy is 99.23% of the RHF -> CASVB difference, while SC is
! 93.54. Adding ionicity 1 (seniority 4) to SC leads to 99.70%, but
! symetry is broken, and adding ionicity 3 (seniority 0) to SC leads i
! to 96.27%. 
!
 $CONTRL SCFTYP=RHF RUNTYP=ENERGY COORD=UNIQUE 
 NOSYM=1 UNITS=BOHR VBTYP=VB2000 $END
 $SYSTEM TIMLIM=200000 MEMORY=2000000 $END
 $BASIS  GBASIS=STO NGAUSS=6 $END
 $GUESS  GUESS=HUCKEL $END
 $DATA
C6H6 STO-6G
Dnh  6

C       6.00    2.642389499    0.000000000    0.000000000
H       1.00    4.687413116    0.000000000    0.000000000
 $END
 $VB2000
#! SEN(6,6)/STO-6G PRINTALL
 
Benzene STO-6G test - MP2 geom 
  
0 1
6     1.3211947495        2.2883764328 0.0000000000
6    -1.3211947495        2.2883764328 0.0000000000
6    -2.6423894990        0.0000000000 0.0000000000
6    -1.3211947495       -2.2883764328 0.0000000000
6     1.3211947495       -2.2883764328 0.0000000000
6     2.6423894990        0.0000000000 0.0000000000
1     2.3437065580        4.0594188365 0.0000000000
1    -2.3437065580        4.0594188365 0.0000000000
1    -4.6874131160        0.0000000000 0.0000000000
1    -2.3437065580       -4.0594188365 0.0000000000
1     2.3437065580       -4.0594188365 0.0000000000
1     4.6874131160        0.0000000000 0.0000000000

 $MEMORY
 20000000

 $CMAXCUT
 0.0

 $NOTROT
 1
 1 2

 $02IONICITY
 2
 0 2 

 02SENIORITY
 2
 6 2

 $MACROITER
 20

 $ECONV
 7
 
 $VBSCF
 0.0001,55

 $AOGROUP
 6
 5,10,15,20,25,30
 2  2  2  2  2  2

 $END

